XB-Kidux-Ages: 10-16
Description: Kidux learning module: Kalzium, the periodic table for ages ten and up
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is Kalzium: the periodic table, every element with what it is like,
 a picture and a drawing of its atom, the states of matter at any
 temperature on a slider, and a glossary, in the child's language and
 without the internet.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
